@rivimey hi, I know that others have started working on drivers for the various peripherals, but I don't expect to see all of them merged very soon (I would say a few months).
The PIO doesn't seem to be supported in the near future. Many other features are not supported yet - such as multi-core, ROM ABI, etc.
So, if waiting is not an option, I wouldn't go with this port.
